    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d744">

                <pb facs="0794" n="782" xml:id="pg782"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">851.6363/10–3145</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Caffery</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 3652</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-10-31">October 31,
                        1945</date>.<lb/>[Received November 13.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Ambassador has the honor to enclose, herewith, a copy of the memorandum
                    forwarded to His Excellency M. Bidault, Ministère des Affaires Etrangères, on
                    the subject of the termination of the Petroleum Supply Agreement. This
                    memorandum was drafted in accordance with the instructions from the Department
                    sent to the Embassy under cable No. 4919, October 23, 1945.<anchor n="17"
                        xml:id="d744-f1"/>
                </p>


                <xi:include href="d744-a1.xml" xpointer="d744-a1"/>
            </div>
